      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giidiinyeanyeeka Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan NG'UTAMIIDA gicha nea gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, gajargweaksiina, gajargweaksiina mujiineeda foojeanda? Asi rukuta gadiyoojiga nyaawa sean munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeeshiina, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ang'iing'i guwoosi mujiineeda bara fugaagu nea gaba geaw, ak ghang'uda geaw ririnnyeanda aba sinooda sanaamajeega, asi nihidu damandaang'u bea girgweaksiinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyasi giidiinyeanda aba foojeandaang'u iihiidi, ak ea ning'unyi ririnnyeanda aba sanaamajeegaagu iisini ak ea nineekiit eawoojigaagu, nea nineekiisi gweanyeakaagu. Asi aba badaydeaba suh naanung' eeyeateeweey ghuut aba jeeda eemoojiga, nea geemachiidaneey aba darooraka sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwajukeey mujiinajeega sheagi ea gea neekachi, ea ang'iing'eeda mideawa ririnnyeanda nea ghwanyiit headaang'u mitagheasta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ula fuga hees bea Israeli mida headaang'u gaygaba nih ahiida foojeanda aba giteena uurdaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba headaang'u sifool ghweanda ea gheamata, nea aba headaang'u ea sisima rabasta ng'asheega munyas ak aba headaang'u ea sighabwas bananga ea masinung'weega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea nifooli haleanjeedeanyu ghaydidi nea ging'udi ririnnyeanda sabaatohajeegeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwanda headaang'u fuga reengani fih, gideaba ghoahiida foojeanda. Nea aba headaang'u ea niyeagiischeewa iheenga giijeega, nea aba headaang'u ea nisin hiseadayeanduumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba headaang'u gwanda fuga weay heeda gadeemga ghweaniga nyaawa. Nea gaweay heeda gadeemga neaweesa eagweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siinuut gwasin ng'asheanda muy gawa heeda gatmooda giischeewoocheandaanyi, nea nuut gawa heeda gatmooda orjeedaanyi, nea nuut gawa heeda huda ghaamwat aba uurda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba headaang'u inyeessa gwanda fuga iissa geasaaw aba gideaba ghoahiida foojeanda. Ninyasi nyageadayda ea gea ahaada, nea ang'iing'i aba shidoodaang'u bea ghaang' ginyasi haleanjeeda aba gideaba giighabwasi giischeewoodigaagu. Ak ea mudu apkaadan, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi ng'ula, naalaschi gida inyasi aba naweeda mwadoabiiwa ea foojeanji mida headaang'uun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi gurooroadaang'u gayghoamu milikghteayda, ghana geatindaang'u gayghoamu gamajeegiiti aba eawoojigiga jea dasimaneey ng'asheegeani? Aniini NG'UTAMIIDA gil, neargu ng'asheanji ak gaydasin gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydeadearseey jeeda eemoojiga, nea ghaanung' una jeeda darooraka. Ak gaydanung' goosha ririnnyeandaang'u gwariteawaneey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeang'uda saseadaang'u ririnnyeanda, aba madeeda eemoojiga, ak gaynala gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duwayda ASEETA siihuuniida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, fuga Israeli aba heedeanyu gawuurji raghwata lapiya, ak gawuurji sean lagheanga oomng'i ea mabwaati, ea gharinyeanda, ea lagheaneeda muundischeanda, mida bugusta duwayda ak ea niiw raghwata lapiya ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba gideaba agooga noowooschi sean raghwata lapiya, ng'ula, gaydabwadaneegwa geat aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gida awaamda buuneeda lapiya, ea lagheanga oomng'i, ea gharinga, ea ghoolghoolga, ea mabwaati aba bugusta duwayda, gideaba eehuuna beasta nea geenung' ghwanyar. Ak ea gida jea daawaamdaneegwa gil aba nyarasteanyu ea nyarasteanyu ak gaydealuuleegwa aba hoowa nea ghaanung' anyara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaha, gaydabwadaneegwa geat, ak gaydaayeat beasta nyarasteanyu aba badaydaang'u, ak gajanyara aba bugustaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidasinung' gwanyariida lapiya aba jeeda duwayda abeeda ea gida jea eenyarjeawdaneegwa gil aba bugustaanyi, ak gajanala gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA, naanung' goobissa nyarasteanyu badaydeang'wa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Riing'eega fuga hees bea Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan NG'UTAMIIDA gicha nea gwayi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, eeshiina ng'eanyiida, ang'iing'i guwoosi ng'eanyiida majeehuun, nea mii gwaroobassa roopta eaweeda nyarasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Foolayda sibangaaschi gwanda jeadaanyi gawuurji ng'adiida amuum nea ghabwaashaada diyeayda. Ak ea niyaak gurooruunatka buuneeda, ak gageanda haleanjeeda siitiiw aba uurda ea haleanjeeda sheayeeda haw, saawa ghoahaat mooneeda masinung'weagaaschi aba jeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashoohoodigaaschi nidatas deaweedeedeanyu ak ea ning'uda ririnnyeanda haleanjeedeanyu ghaydidi. Mooheeli haleanjeeda ghaydidi ea haleanjeeda sigadiyeata galeagasean, nea mii ghwanal buuneeda gooheeli haleanjeeda ririnnyeanda ea haleanjeeda miyaas, ak ea nidukuta gheanyanga nyaawa, ea mang'ula sabaatohajeegeasu ak ea sing'udanaan ririnnyeanda aba bugusta nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fugaaschi heeda mida headaanyi gawuurji suuyeeka bwaashaada diyeayda, aba gideaba ghoahiida foojeanda. Nea ghwadatas gurooruunatka buuneeda, ak ghwanyagaada aba naweeda mwadoabiiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibangaaschi ghafuy ng'asheega munyas, suh gawuurji siida yeasha roonghooda ghamarda nyaraat. Ak ghwadaah gidasiihhiimsa bea ng'uyyeega, nea gwaramoor ng'asheega ng'uyeega nea geeyi, ‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA’, nea aniini ea mii dargu gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga ng'eanyiida nisin ng'asheega munyas, nea ghoareat aba uurda, asaha, niireat fuga barbari ea gea gasa weeta ak saawa ea nighabwas rabasta aba naweeda mwadoabiiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geagasayi siida aba jeenyaawa jea ghwajap hilgweanda, ak ghamiinaada aba madeedeanyu aba heeda nyaraat, aba badayda ng'eanyiida, aba gideaba adiidu ghaadataschi ak ea mwaadaahi sih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba seareeni ea niibisa nyarasteanyu badahuuka nyaawa. Naanung' goosha aba beasta nyarasteanyu aba giteena sinaweega nyaawa gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
